    "<p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><b>'Career Strategy, Personal Branding &amp; Resume Workshop' Applications Open</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><b><br></b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><b>SeoulGlobalCenter is hosting a one-day English workshop <stand out=\"\" in=\"\" the=\"\" korean=\"\" job=\"\" market=\"\" 🗃-=\"\" career=\"\" strategy,=\"\" personal=\"\" branding=\"\" &=\"\" resume=\"\" workshop=\"\">for foreign students and foreign residents preparing for employment in Korea.</stand></b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><b>Learn how to stand out in the Korean job market, identify your unique strengths, build your personal brand, and create a resume that gets noticed.</b></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">✨ Application Period: Aug. 26 (Wed.) – Sep. 11 (Fri.)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">✨ Date &amp; Venue: Sep. 19 (Sat), 11:00–14:00 / room 404, SeoulGlobalCenter (line no.1 Jonggak station)</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">✅ Eligibility: Foreign residents preparing for employment in Korea, including:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">* D-10 visa holders actively seeking employment</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">* Foreign talents experiencing challenges in their job search</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">* Foreign students nearing graduation and preparing to enter the Korean job market</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">❗️ This program will be conducted entirely in English.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">✅ Program Topics</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">🗃 Understanding the Korean Job Market: Explore the latest hiring trends and why qualified candidates may still struggle to land interviews.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">📝 Hands-on Career &amp; Resume Workshop: Identify the key skills Korean companies are looking for, learn how to communicate your strengths effectively, and create a more impactful resume.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">🪄 Free Personalized AI Assessment: Get a free AI-powered assessment of your individual strengths and resume, with personalized insights to help strengthen your job application.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">✅ Speaker: AGOSSOU CASIMIR, CEO of Acafo (A capacity-building employment consulting firm for foreigners)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">✅ Apply: submit the Google Form 👉 </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 239, 0); font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://forms.gle/ginaPvu2qbvQ7iv4A\">https://forms.gle/ginaPvu2qbvQ7iv4A</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">✅ Final Participant Announcement: Scheduled for Sep. 11 (Fri.)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">(Selected applicants will be notified individually)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">※ This is NOT first-come, first-served. Participants will be selected based on motivation, suitability for the program, and other considerations.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">※&nbsp; This program requires a personal laptop or tablet.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">📞 Inquiry: SeoulGlobalCenter 📧***@**.**</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p>": 1,
    "<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">서울글로벌센터에서는 한국 취업을 준비하는 외국인 유학생 및 외국인주민을 대상으로,&nbsp;</span></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">한국 취업 시장에서 나를 차별화하는 전략을 개발 할 수 있는 원데이 영어 워크숍&nbsp;</span></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">'</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Career Strategy, Personal Branding &amp; Resume' </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">을 운영합니다. 🚀</span></p><p><br></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">✨신청 기간: 8. 26.(수) ~ 9. 11.(금)&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">✨일시 및 장소: 9. 19.(토) 11:00~14:00 / 서울글로벌센터 404호</span></p><p><br></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">✅ 신청 대상</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">한국 취업을 준비하는 외국인 주민(적극적인 구직활동을 하는 D-10 비자 소지자, 구직 중 어려움을 겪고 있는 외국인 인재, 한국 취업 시장 진입을 앞둔 졸업 예정 외국인 유학생 등)&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">❗️이 프로그램은 영어로 진행됩니다.</span></p><p><br></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">✅ 프로그램 내용</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">🗃 한국 취업 시장의 이해: 채용시장 최신 트렌드, 역량있는 지원자가 면접 기회를 얻지 못하는 원인 분석 등&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">📝 실전 워크숍: 한국 기업을 겨냥한 핵심 역량 도출 및 어필 전략, 임팩트 있는 이력서 작성법</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">🪄 개인별 맞춤형 역량 및 이력서 검증 AI 테스트 무료 제공&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">✅ 강사: Acafo 대표 아고쏘우 카지미 CEO (외국인을 위한 역량강화 취업 컨설팅 기업)</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">✅ 신청 방법 : 구글폼 작성 후 제출 👉 </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 239, 0); font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://forms.gle/ginaPvu2qbvQ7iv4A\">https://forms.gle/ginaPvu2qbvQ7iv4A</a>&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">✅ 최종 참여자 발표: 9. 11.(금) 예정, 개별 안내</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">※ 선착순 아님! (참여 동기 및 프로그램 적합성 등을 종합적으로 고려하여 선발)&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">※ 이 프로그램은 개인 노트북이나 태블릿이 필요합니다.</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"></span></p><p><br></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">📞 문의: 서울글로벌센터 📧 ***@**.**</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p>": 1,
